category: Libs
requires: bash libgdal-devel libpdal20 libxml2-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "Point Data Abstraction Library (development)"
ldesc: "PDAL is Point Data Abstraction Library. It is a C/C++ open source library and
applications for translating and processing point cloud data. It is not
limited to LiDAR data, although the focus and impetus for many of the tools in
the library have their origins in LiDAR."
external-source: pdal

